   "idea": "Replace the naive next\u2011fit loop (iterating items in input order) with a first\u2011fit decreasing strategy\u2014sort indices by decreasing item size and always put each item into the first bin that fits, creating a new bin when necessary; this cuts wasted slots and typically halves the number of bins."
